<header>
	<h1>Billing</h1>

	<p>
		Billing gives you access to reports on charges that agents have made to tickets.
		Billing reports include lists of charges and totals for charges per person, agent and organization.
	</p>
</header>
<article>
	<article>
				<section>
			<p>
				To use ticket billing, you will need to enable it from <strong>Tickets > Time Log & Billing</strong>.
			</p>

			<p>
				If you need custom billing reports, you can create them using the Report Builder.
			
			</p>
			</section>

	</article>
</article>
